+    Step 6 (ERR-0004, 2026-09-11): an outlier is marked when
+    ``|x - median| > max(3 * 1.4826 * MAD, floor)`` with
+    ``floor = max(1 µs, 0.02 * median)``.  The floor keeps microsecond timer
+    jitter on WSL2 from being classified as contamination while a real
+    (>2%) excursion is still marked.
+    """
 
     if not values:
